---

Every line here is original. This mod implements the same idea as Hold My Beer:
Empty Hand (ItsWormy / littlebroto1), but no code, asset, string or version
lineage from that mod is present, and none of it was copied or adapted. The one
thing the two share is which two vanilla bounds checks have to be widened, which
is Minecraft's own API rather than anyone's authorship. See the README.

No third-party code is bundled. Sophisticated Backpacks is an optional compile-
time dependency only, resolved from the local install and never redistributed.
